# scripts/orchestration/

High-level run orchestration and state management.

## Files

run_controller.py      - Main controller, executes run phases
run_phases.py          - RunPhase enum and phase definitions
run_context.py         - RunContext class (immutable run info)
run_state.py           - RunState class (mutable state tracking)
run_setup.py           - Pre-run setup (directories, validation)
run_cleanup.py         - Post-run cleanup (tmp/, logging)
run_reporter.py        - Run summary and reporting
run_validation.py      - Configuration validation orchestration
multi_run_controller.py - Multiple run orchestration
generate_all.py        - Master file generation orchestrator

## Interfaces

run_controller.execute_run(config) -> int (exit code)
RunContext: Immutable run parameters
RunState: Mutable state (current phase, status, errors)